{"ticker":"PFC","symbol":"PFC","instrumentId":3094009,"name":"Power Finance Corpn.","industry":"NSE-Financial Svcs-Specialty","about":"Power Finance Corporation Ltd. (PFC) is a premier financial institution in India, specializing in the funding of power sector projects. It provides financial assistance for power generation, transmission, and distribution, contributing significantly to the development of India's energy infrastructure. PFC plays a crucial role in supporting the country's energy transition by financing renewable energy projects and sustainable initiatives. Its services include long-term and short-term loans, as well as debt restructuring for state and central utilities, independent power producers, and private sector players. With a strong focus on the energy sector, PFC is instrumental in driving India’s power and energy security.","website":"www.pfcindia.co.in","location":"New Delhi, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:49:45.458Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":331.6,"changePct":2.4880234894143136,"week52High":481.4,"week52Low":313.6},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹1,09,431 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹1,15,586 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"1,452,044,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"897"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"1,108,245,572"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"4.58%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"0.82"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.03"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.17"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"17%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"4.15"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"2–9"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"19.5%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"-13.65"},{"label":"Volume","value":"6,859,841"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"8,506,191"},{"label":"Master score","value":"46"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"59"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"33"},{"label":"Group